  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): マルバハッカ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9E%E3%83%AB%E3%83%90%E3%83%8F%E3%83%83%E3%82%AB",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 109081321,
      "text": "マルバハッカ は、東西ヨーロッパから地中海地域西部に分布するシソ科ハッカ属の多年草である。本種は芳香があり、料理用ハーブあるいはグラウンドカバーとしてもっとも普通に用いられる宿根草である。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Mentha suaveolens",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mentha_suaveolens",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1308239778,
      "text": "Mentha suaveolens, the apple mint, pineapple mint, woolly mint or round-leafed mint, is a member of the mint family Lamiaceae. It is native to southern and western Europe including the Mediterranean region. It is a herbaceous, upright perennial plant that is most commonly grown as a culinary herb or for ground cover."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Mentha suaveolens",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mentha_suaveolens",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 158739230,
      "text": "El mastranzo, también conocido como padrastro dependiendo de la región es una planta perenne, rizomatosa y a veces estolonífera, de la familia de las lamiáceas."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Menthe odorante",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Menthe_odorante",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 228911743,
      "text": "La menthe odorante ou menthe à feuilles rondes est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Lamiacées. C'est une plante herbacée originaire de l'Ancien Monde."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Mentha suaveolens",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mentha_suaveolens",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 65314437,
      "text": "Mentha suaveolens, comummente conhecida como hortelã-brava, é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família das Lamiáceas e ao tipo fisionómico dos proto-hemicriptófitos."
    }
  },
